# astrion-skill v1
goal: Set an alarm for a specific time
trigger:
  - phrase: "wake me up at"
  - phrase: "alarm for"
  - phrase: "set alarm"
do: |
  Parse the user's text for a target time ("7am", "in 8 hours",
  "tomorrow at 6:30"). Schedule a system alarm via system.scheduleAlarm.
  Show a confirmation notification with the scheduled time. When the
  alarm fires, raise display brightness gradually + play an alert
  sound + show a dismissible notification.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 250
  reversibility: BOUNDED
